    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5c08093fb6494ef9a5a8e3620bcc1624",
      "statement": "The settings are plain JSON rather than a ScriptableSingleton asset so that shell and Python tooling outside Unity can read the same virtual environment the Editor uses.",
